{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31819","headline":"送韩湘 · 贾岛","name":"送韩湘","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"挂席从古路，长风起广津。\n楚城花未发，上苑蝶来新。\n半没湖波月，初生岛草春。\n孤霞临石镜，极浦映村神。\n细响吟乾苇，余馨动远苹。\n欲凭将一札，寄与沃洲人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31819.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31819","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}